                "value": "<bdi><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Johann_Kerseboom\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Johann Kerseboom\"><span title=\"German painter\">Johann Kerseboom</span></a></bdi>",
